<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-10-22T01:40:26.440Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 01:40:26 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Islamic State-affiliated militants killed at least 48 civilians in eastern Mali, while separate gunmen attacks in Mali killed over 40 civilians. In Burkina Faso the military junta reinstated the death penalty as it confronts an escalating jihadist insurgency. The war across Mali, Niger and Burkina Faso caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP. These actions show a continuation of lethal attacks by Islamist groups and a hardening legal response by the Burkina Faso junta.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPRDhKTTlnTVFYd3l3M3VlTHNiMXNwNE9GdkRBeGg1ZXk2eUVnRUl2c3V3Z1ZrZTk2djJLeGhIb3A1NlpTeWs2UWFtYkdhLXJjUS1aTVBfcHE2eGFwR21YdDhBOTlUVXpyb3pnX0xGRkpXaDNCM2c2LTJsNDVlaXFDUy14SWItaW5jOVBabDZZMF82em5oN2hHaFU4Vm90Tm5oVGV4ZVUzUkxLc0l0b2xTVUphUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPZ0ZjaXJEa1d4RWN6NnVKTkRkdTdlYURrUktWMVlvQ1ZueGZCZlpaQjZQZzNMc3BvdVpQa3Zhc2ZiVW8tQ2xfbXF0UERPRUtfUTBpaklybzQtSzY1alVXN3RXXy1LMEZCUkFnRDRCQkFyWVczdUItR1ExQUNpTUc3STJEbkxJV1lUVDlWQnQyN3RTcUJHSUxBUm1yVE4?oc=5&quot;&gt;streamlinefeed.co.ke&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNR0NWNk9UVS0waTlQeS1CNm5ZX2tIZ0tuTGxYZEk4VnpadlVHOUQ3b1ltTXhwMnRlRTlMMzFCX1BCNHUwanhUTkJKcUlFSWxCa3J6UUFVOVVCLWJ5THlsREl5ODJYbFljSnd0OXg2NGN6QVI5OHNIWE1PcFFFQVNqQm81Zk5lSEpvUENMZXZkTTRIa1NFWE04U0JZSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CitiNewsroom.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPVmctX0VwV1ZXRjRqNTQzRTd0SEEzU1ZJYW5Rb0RRNzFuZllXb2xaX043TlhDZ2YwU3g1OFVENTc2QVFtWWJxdVg2RWt6UFFnT3FWR2NjWE5xX2t3Uk1XR1JWclVXVkdHYnlxZlhzdklBYVdWSVA4eXZ1Y2V6X